<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 14.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shadowdance 60,000 long tons grain Up River plus Brazil/Continent 20-30/10 $13.75 fio 14 days Cargill (adds vessel name).</p>
<p>TBN 25,000 long tons 1-10/11 Mississippi/Aqaba four days 3,000 $22.00 Lorico.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
